						<description>The archotechs are all aspects of one supermind. At death, each person's consciousness is accepted or rejected by the archotechs. In the future, the archotechs will finish their moral debate about the fate of humanity. Those who follow their signs will be admitted to a higher plane of existence, and those that do not will end.</description>
