						<name>Blood hungry crypt</name>
						<adjective>lifeist</adjective>
						<memberName>Lifeist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Universe chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Universe chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The vampire bat knows the strength that comes from drinking of blood. There is no greater strength than that which comes from human blood. Spirits become restless when humanity attempts to change them from their true nature. It is said that a sleeping traveler from the stars will crash to the earth, and the spirit of the crater will wake the traveller who will raise the last tribe.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The vampire bat knows the strength that comes from drinking of blood. There is no greater strength than that which comes from human blood. Spirits become restless when humanity attempts to change them from their true nature. It is said that a sleeping traveler from the stars will crash to the earth, and the spirit of the crater will wake the traveller who will raise the last tribe.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>PoliticalE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightPurple</colorDef>
