						<name>Deep shaft</name>
						<adjective>Deep-Tantric</adjective>
						<memberName>Deep-Tantran</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In an old universe of strife, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vishnu&lt;/color&gt; whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vishnu&lt;/color&gt; filled the rocks with rich minerals and resources as a gift to those wise enough to dig down to be closer to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vishnu&lt;/color&gt;. Humanity's suffering brought &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vishnu&lt;/color&gt; to terrible grief.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In an old universe of strife, %%deity0_name%% whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. %%Deity0_name%% filled the rocks with rich minerals and resources as a gift to those wise enough to dig down to be closer to %%deity0_name%%. Humanity's suffering brought %%deity0_name%% to terrible grief.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>StarsE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkOrange</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.320, 0.779, 0.381, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginHindu</li>
							<li>Tunneler</li>
						</memes>
