						<name>Bagucinquan herd</name>
						<adjective>purist</adjective>
						<memberName>Purifier</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Awoken cheese</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Awoken cheese</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The first ten among my followers tore the devices from their skin with bare hands, and in the blood spatters on the grimy floor I suddenly perceived the truth we had all been missing: The animals are our partners in this world, and it's wrong to treat them as any less. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - Klara Stuart</description>
