						<name>Strong legion</name>
						<adjective>Nova-Azraqi</adjective>
						<memberName>Nova-Azraqi</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Grand victor</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Grand victor</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>For an eternity, there was a world of white water, until &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;As-Salam&lt;/color&gt; created the planets and stars. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;As-Salam&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign." Across the vast stellar distances, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;As-Salam&lt;/color&gt;'s will sustained the life of mankind against the void.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>For an eternity, there was a world of white water, until %%deity0_name%% created the planets and stars. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign." Across the vast stellar distances, %%deity0_name%%'s will sustained the life of mankind against the void.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>StarsC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightMauve</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.317, 0.598, 0.970, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginIslamic</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Nova-Azraqi requiem</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>308</ID>
								<randomSeed>-466118875</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFuneral</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>You can hold a {IDEOLIGION_adjective} funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>You can hold a funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>FuneralStandard</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_GraveWithTarget">
									<def>GraveWithTargetsCorpse</def>
									<parent>Precept_308</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior Class="RitualBehaviorWorker_Funeral">
									<def>Funeral</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="RitualObligationTrigger_MemberDied">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality">
									<def>AttendedFuneral</def>
									<compDatas>
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_DataThingPresence">
											<presentForTicks>
												<keys />
												<values />
											</presentForTicks>
										</li>
									</compDatas>
								</outcomeEffect>
								<layerWhitelist IsNull="True" />
								<layerBlacklist IsNull="True" />
								<activeObligations IsNull="True" />
								<completedObligations IsNull="True" />
