						<name>The legion</name>
						<adjective>just</adjective>
						<memberName>Justicar</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Awoken boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Awoken boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Nadine Ayers boiled with rage. She escaped, formed her gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from her. One day while walking the streets, Nadine was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Nadine instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a chem-warfare bomb to kill everyone inside.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Persecuted and imprisoned, Nadine Ayers boiled with rage. She escaped, formed her gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from her. One day while walking the streets, Nadine was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Nadine instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a chem-warfare bomb to kill everyone inside.</descriptionTemplate>
