					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Yttak</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Bonetor</name>
									<type>Goddess of space</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Shipborn</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Agonism</name>
						<adjective>agonist</adjective>
						<memberName>Agonist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Holy divus</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Holy divus</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Agonist built a great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Mark of agony&lt;/color&gt; on the ice-moon prison Yttak, so that many would come to hear &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bonetor&lt;/color&gt;'s divine word. A prison warden offered bodily comforts to the Agonist to soothe their daily suffering. But in their comfort, they became dependent on the prison warden, who gained power over them. A renowned escapee named Zachary Galante brought the Agonist together, and even recruited some of the corrupt guards. Then Zachary spoke with &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bonetor&lt;/color&gt;'s voice. In a brilliant convergence of light and energy, Zachary overwhelmed his enemies and led his people to the holy ships.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%MemberNamePlural%% built a great %%altar0_name%% on the ice-moon prison Yttak, so that many would come to hear %%deity0_name%%'s divine word. A prison warden offered bodily comforts to the %%memberNamePlural%% to soothe their daily suffering. But in their comfort, they became dependent on the prison warden, who gained power over them. A renowned escapee named Zachary Galante brought the %%memberNamePlural%% together, and even recruited some of the corrupt guards. Then Zachary spoke with %%deity0_name%%'s voice. In a brilliant convergence of light and energy, Zachary overwhelmed his enemies and led his people to the holy ships.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>GeometryE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.570, 0.470, 0.290, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistAbstract</li>
							<li>PainIsVirtue</li>
							<li>Proselytizer</li>
							<li>Shipborn</li>
