						<name>Crew of spiritualism</name>
						<adjective>spiritual</adjective>
						<memberName>Spiritist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine starborn</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine starborn</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In the days of darkness, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Dir&lt;/color&gt; saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded his Spiritist to build great ships. There was peace, until a corrupt bureaucrat and his bionic guards rebelled against &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Dir&lt;/color&gt;'s dominion. The Spiritist were forced to flee to a hidden space elevator. A hero named Robbie Beltran tried to assassinate the corrupt bureaucrat. He failed, but &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Dir&lt;/color&gt; witnessed Robbie's struggle, and anointed him as the prophet of the Spiritist. Robbie sacrificed himself to personally kill the corrupt bureaucrat.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In the days of darkness, %%deity0_name%% saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded %%deity0_possessive%% %%memberNamePlural%% to build great ships. There was peace, until a corrupt bureaucrat and his bionic guards rebelled against %%deity0_name%%'s dominion. The %%memberNamePlural%% were forced to flee to a hidden space elevator. A hero named Robbie Beltran tried to assassinate the corrupt bureaucrat. He failed, but %%deity0_name%% witnessed Robbie's struggle, and anointed him as the prophet of the %%memberNamePlural%%. Robbie sacrificed himself to personally kill the corrupt bureaucrat.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>GeometryA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkGreen</colorDef>
